    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "観客や視聴者のみんなも、\nアタシたちが愛する歌舞伎や落語、それに茶道♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "performance": {
